{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["為埃及唱哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要說預言，宣告主耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『哀號吧！你們要為那日悲傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為日子近了，耶和華的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那將是烏雲密佈的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是列國淪亡的時候。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有刀劍攻擊埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及必屍橫遍野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實必痛苦不堪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人要擄掠埃及的財富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀她的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實、弗、路德、阿拉伯和利比亞及其他盟友都必與她一同死於刀下。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『埃及的盟友都要覆滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的傲氣必蕩然無存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從密奪到色弗尼的居民都要喪身刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及要變成荒地中的荒地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑要淪為廢墟中的廢墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要點火燒埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的所有盟友都要滅亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，他們就知道我是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「『在那日，我要差遣使者乘船出去驚嚇安逸的古實人，在埃及遭難的日子，他們必痛苦不堪。看啊，這日子快到了。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「主耶和華說，",{"text":"「『我要藉巴比倫王尼布甲尼撒的手消滅埃及的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他和追隨他的都是萬民中最殘暴的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們去毀滅埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拔刀攻擊那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使埃及屍骨遍野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使尼羅河乾涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把土地賣給惡人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要藉外族人的手使埃及及其境內的一切都荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我耶和華說的。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"「主耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我要毀滅偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除挪弗的神像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及再沒有君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使埃及境內充滿恐懼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使巴特羅荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"放火焚燒瑣安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"審判底比斯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把我的烈怒傾倒在埃及的訓堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消滅底比斯的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要放火燒埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"訓必受極大的痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底比斯要被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗終日困苦不已，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞文和比伯實的壯丁必死於刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾城都要遭受擄掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我粉碎埃及勢力的那天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"答比匿必日月無光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的銳氣全消。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烏雲必籠罩她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她城邑的居民必被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必這樣審判埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就知道我是耶和華。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["第十一年一月七日，耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["「人子啊，我打斷了埃及王法老的一隻臂膀，沒有人替他敷藥包紮，以致他無力拿刀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["因此，主耶和華說，『我要與埃及王法老為敵，我要把他那強壯的臂膀和曾經受傷的臂膀一起打斷，使刀從他手中掉落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我要把埃及人驅散到列國，分散到列邦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["我要使巴比倫王的臂膀強壯有力，把我的刀交在他手中。我要打斷法老的臂膀，使法老在他面前像受了致命傷的人一樣呻吟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["我要使巴比倫王的臂膀強壯有力，而法老的雙臂必軟弱無力。我要把我的刀交在巴比倫王手中，讓他揮刀攻擊埃及。那時他們就知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["我要把埃及人驅散到列國，分散到列邦，這樣他們就知道我是耶和華。』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}